## The terminal renderer for `ui`: the `Surface` host trait, `run_app!` with
## its event loop and worker pool, the JavaScript provider in
## `providers/tui.mjs`, and `Recorder`, an hd `Surface` for tests. The same
## shape as `ui-dom`: one trait, one provider file and one loop per renderer
## (`docs/packages.md`).
pub use pkg.surface.{Surface}
pub use pkg.app.{run_app}
pub use pkg.recorder.{Recorder, scripted}
